<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN TUESDAY SCHEDULE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN TUESDAY SCHEDULE.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singles schedule on the ninth day of the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Centre Court (2345 GMT Monday start)</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) v 14-Felix Mantilla (Spain)</p>
<p>12-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) v Kimberly Po (U.S.)</p>
<p>Night session (0800 GMT start)</p>
<p>16-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) v Mary Pierce (France)</p>
<p>9-Marcelo Rios (Chile) v 2-Michael Chang (U.S.).</p>
